@startuml task_topic_membership_policy_rebuild
!pragma layout smetana
title Типизированная задача проекции: topic_membership_policy_rebuild
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "Outbox членства/политики" as OUTBOX
participant "Проектор задач" as PROJECTOR
database "Типизированные задачи" as TASKS
database "Захват темы" as CLAIM
participant "Слот воркера" as WORKER
database "Последнее членство/политика" as POLICY
database "MESSAGE_PLACEMENT" as PLACEMENTS
database "USER_TOPIC_BINDING\nUSER_MESSAGE_BINDING" as BINDINGS
database "Downstream outbox exact scopes" as FOLLOWUPS
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as EVENTS
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "Клиент" as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : зафиксированное событие членства/политики
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable topic_membership_policy_rebuild\n(outbox_event_uuid, scope=topic)\nunique derivation; без coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : явная область темы
WORKER -> CLAIM : монопольно (проект, тема)
WORKER -> POLICY : active membership + expected generation
WORKER -> PLACEMENTS : прочитать явные размещения
note right of PLACEMENTS
  Массовый порядок по MESSAGE.created_at DESC:
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
end note
group одна DB transaction
  loop затронутые пользователи/размещения
    WORKER -> BINDINGS : conditional upsert при generation equality;\nstale task = no-op
  end
  WORKER -> FOLLOWUPS : immutable outbox events exact scopes:\nuser-stream / user-topic / user-folder
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready topic-scoped rows
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : безопасно освободить
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : устойчивые записи
DISPATCHER -> Client : отправить / повторить / воспроизвести

note over TASKS,BINDINGS
  Тот же exact topic-scope protocol обслуживает отдельный
  TASK_KIND topic_state_projection для ready topic.updated;
  authoritative TOPIC.is_done меняется только синхронной командой.
  Revoke active=false + generation++ синхронен;
  stale rows не дают доступ и cleanup не security boundary.
  Topic worker shared rows не пишет.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper обязательны.
end note

@enduml
